{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Mahānāma","html":"<article id='thag1.115'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.115 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.115 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Dvādasamavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Twelve </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Mahānāmattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Mahānāma </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Esāvahiyyase pabbatena, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>By Mount Nesādaka, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Bahukuṭajasallakikena; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>with its famous covering </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Nesādakena girinā, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>of abundant shrubs and trees, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Yasassinā paricchadenā”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>you’re found deficient. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Mahānāmo thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
